1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:03,200
Narrator：Listen to a teacher talking to a group of students.

2
00:00:03,200 --> 00:00:10,020
Teacher：The new computer laboratory is looking to hire several students as part-time employees.

3
00:00:10,020 --> 00:00:17,240
These jobs are available only to students specialized in Computer Science or Computer Engineering.

4
00:00:17,240 --> 00:00:24,063
Since the lab is open 24 hours a day and has just opened, students

5
00:00:24,063 --> 00:00:26,290
can work at just about any time.

6
00:00:26,290 --> 00:00:33,851
Student employees will be expected to advise student users on how to operate the computers

7
00:00:33,851 --> 00:00:37,140
and to fix any problems that arise.
